{"id": "TASK-20261018-LEGISTAR-CHAIN", "status": "done", "date": "2026-10-18", "title": "Reconstruct the full authorization chain for the Cameron Lane shelter from Legistar (separate system from Laserfiche); retrieve Resolution 2019-22 and executed agreements", "laws": ["Law 15 (official records)", "Law 2 (execute, don't request)"], "result": "Resolution 2019-22 obtained (File 19-455 / MatterId 2430, scanned 2pp, OCR). Chain: 20-1384/1386 closed session; 20-1432 acquisition from Yamada trusts; 20-1577/1578 Emergency Facility Use Agreement (County TASS); 20-1777 withdrawn; 20-1761 tabled (Gothard St alternative); 20-1799 operating authorization + Mercy House $2,596,240; 20-1875 portable buildings; 25-467 Mercy House 2025 $2,528,715.13; 26-225 County MOU $500,000 HHAP to 6/30/2028 (164 beds, 17631 Cameron); 26-464 Newport MOU 10 beds (17642 Beach Blvd).", "evidence": "C:\\Amd949609_Antigravity_v1\\evidence\\hbnc_records\\LEGISTAR_RESO_2019-22_20261018", "manifest_sha256": "0980bfd4a2a711da8f11c63074ee7239af31026c21a252a283a304629077afd0", "files": 82}
{"id": "TASK-20261018-ACCELA-INSPECT", "status": "done", "date": "2026-10-18", "title": "Enumerate Accela permit records for 17631 Cameron Ln and test the B2020-004554 daily-results cross-reference", "laws": ["Law 15 (official records)"], "classification": "OBSERVED RECORD ANOMALY - intent UNVERIFIED", "entry_id": "OBSTR-HBNC-ACCELA-2026-10-18-05", "result": "11 Building records captured. All show zero completed inspections, incl. CO2020-005184 (Issued) and M2020-004979/M2020-006464 (Finaled). B2020-004554 is a demolition permit (800 SF SFD) with no inspections and no public attachments, yet is designated as the 'daily results' repository by every shelter permit. CofO and shell permit share the 2020-09-11 date. Control could not be established (CSRF-protected search; Engineering module has no Inspections tab) - stated as a limitation.", "evidence": "C:\\Amd949609_Antigravity_v1\\evidence\\hbnc_records\\ACCELA_CAPTURE_20261018", "manifest_sha256": "4b784cc44e26e5ab8fd168a4843237d8a4ae5f5729d801c1c6a2a3a897427299", "files": 14}
